model_output_raw:
Is é an t-choitinneanna seo a leanas a bhíonn teastach le haghaidh pearsanta-údarúcháin:

- Aonad: ag rith ina dtugtar, mar shampla, 'mínic', 'fótaí' nó 'bliain'.
- Aonraíocht fad: mar 'tugtar', 'fótaí' nó 'liosta'.
- Príomh-údarúchán: ag rith ina dtugtar, mar shampla, 'camasach', 'pile', nó 'bliain-scrios', agus ag rith ina dtugtar an dá chuid de shonraí.
- Saincheisteachtaí: mar shampla, 'fichlí' nó 'nóraí'.
- Údarúchán a bhí feidhmchlaid: teiligh aonraíocht fad ar an príomh-údarúchán nó saincheisteachtaí ina dtugtar.
- Príomh-údarúchán/leagan: ag rith ina dtugtar, mar shampla, 'camasach', 'pile', nó 'bliain-scrios', agus ag rith ina dtugtar an dá chuid de shonraí.

Seachas seo, is é seo a leanas ar feadh téarmaí Python a fhágáil chun éifeachtúil a dhéanamh:

In aonaid, ag díriú gach idirghníomhaíocht:

from datetime import datetime

class Person:
    def __init__(self, name, birth_date):
        self.name = name
        self.birth_date = birth_date

    def age(self):
        today = datetime.now()
        return today.year - self.birth_date.year - ((today.month, today.day) < (self.birth_date.month, self.birth_date.day))

    def birth_year(self):
        return self.birth_date.year

    def birth_month(self):
        return self.birth_date.month

    def birth_day(self):
        return self.birth_date.day

class User:
    def __init__(self, name, birth_date, gender):
        self.name = name
        self.birth_date = birth_date
        self.gender = gender

    def age(self):
        today = datetime.now()
        return today.year - self.birth_date.year - ((today.month, today.day) < (self.birth_date.month, self.birth_date.day))

    def birth_year(self):
        return self.birth_date.year

    def birth_month(self):
        return self.birth_date.month

    def birth_day(self):
        return self.birth_date.day

    def gender(self):
        return self.gender

class Role:
    def __init__(self, name, start_date):
        self.name = name
        self.start_date = start_date

    def start_year(self):
        return self.start_date.year

    def start_month(self):
        return self.start_date.month

    def start_day(self):
        return self.start_date.day

class PersonRole:
    def __init__(self, person, role):
        self.person = person
        self.role = role

    def person_name(self):
        return self.person.name

    def role_name(self):
        return self.role.name

    def role_start_year(self):
        return self.role.start_year()

    def role_start_month(self):
        return self.role.start_month()

    def role_start_day(self):
        return self.role.start_day()

class Team:
    def __init__(self, name):
        self.name = name

    def create_person_role(self, person, role):
        self.person_roles.append(PersonRole(person, role))

    def list_person_roles(self):
        return self.person_roles

    def list_roles(self):
        return self.roles

class TeamMember:
    def __init__(self, name):
        self.name = name

    def is_team_member(self, team):
        return self in team.list_team_members()

    def is_role_member(self, role):
        return self in role.team_members

class TeamMemberRole:
    def __init__(self, team_member, role):
        self.team_member = team_member
        self.role = role

    def role_name(self):
        return self.role.name

    def role_start_year(self):
        return self.role.start_year()

    def role_start_month(self):
        return self.role.start_month()

    def role_start_day(self):
        return self.role.start_day()

class TeamRoles:
    def __init__(self, team):
        self.team = team

    def list_team_roles(self):
        return self.team.list_team_roles()

class TeamRole:
    def __init__(self, team, role):
        self.team = team
        self.role = role

